B.acu=new A.a8("The bloom is static decoration: excluded from semantics, with no animation to still under reduced motion. Layer it between a `DsAuthGradient` and the page content, and tune `opacity` when the glow competes with what sits on top. Like the wash, it fills the bounds its parent provides.")
B.ae0=new A.a8("A marketing backdrop sometimes pools more than one of the brand's hues, and the theme can only name one of them in `bloomColor`. Pass `color` to give a second glow the brand's other tint. Pass another token, never a literal: a hardcoded hue is the one thing on the page a re-skin cannot reach.")
