B.adn=new A.a8("The system is tested the way it is used: every component holds from a 320dp phone to a 1920dp desktop without overflow, and the docs sweep each live demo across eleven widths between those ends. Treat the boundaries as ranges, not targets; a layout must flex all the way through a class, not just at its edges. Honour the user's text scale too: text wraps or ellipsizes, it never clips.")
B.ZO=s([B.adD,B.aml,B.awL,B.amt,B.awH,B.adn],t.E)
B.ZP=s(["Don't put primary actions in the status bar.","Don't let the label wrap; it ellipsizes to keep the strip slim.","Don't stack status bars; one strip closes the frame."],t.s)
B.ZR=s(["Use a group for a handful of options; a select handles a long list better.","Keep labels to a word or two so the row keeps its rhythm.","Give a chip `onRemoved` when it represents something the user added."],t.s)
