B.ZV=s(["Don't hide Prev or Next at the edges; the control already disables them and keeps the layout stable.",'Don\'t compose your own range label above the grid; the pagination row is the single source of "where am I" truth.',"Don't show the page-size select when the caller cannot honour it \u2014 omit `onPageSizeChanged` and it disappears."],t.s)
