B.acw=new A.a8("With `inlineLead` the lead continues the title's own paragraph in a lighter weight, so the pair reads as one flowing sentence: a bold question followed by a muted why. That is the house style for onboarding steps. The default keeps the lead as its own paragraph beneath the title, which suits longer supporting copy. The alignment option matches the heading alignment used by the sign-in and sign-up views, so adjacent screens line up.")
B.ZY=s([B.acw],t.E)
