B.a_w=s(['Use DsFieldLabel when a label must sit on the same row as an inline action, such as a "Forgot password?" link.',"Let DsTextField render its own label whenever the field can own it.","Keep the text to a short noun phrase that names the control.","Match the label wording to the field it captions so the pairing is obvious."],t.s)
