B.aed=new A.a8("One law above all: **respect reduced motion.** When a person has asked their platform for less motion, animation is not softened. It is removed. Resolve every duration and curve through `DsMotion.durationOf` and `DsMotion.curveOf`, which collapse to a still, instant change under the setting, and gate any bespoke animation behind `DsMotion.reduced`. The live demo obeys this: press Replay with reduce-motion on and it stays put.")
