B.aem=new A.a8('The chip is generic over its value type, so it can carry an enum, an id or any domain value without stringly-typed lookups. When more than one filter is active, offer a single "Clear filters" link beside the chips so people can reset the view in one step. If a combination of filters leaves no matching records, replace the table with an empty state that explains why and offers a way back.')
