B.acz=new A.a8("The reveal stays collapsed by default, so the first thing anyone sees is the title, a short description and the primary action. Expanding it surfaces supporting lines without navigating away or resetting the form. Keep the hidden content to a few short sentences or bullet rows; if the explanation grows into paragraphs or requires acknowledgement, move it to a separate screen instead.")
