B.a1S=s(["Do not use two radios for a single yes/no question; use one checkbox or a switch instead.","Do not use a switch for a change that must be confirmed with a Save; use a checkbox inside the form.","Do not leave a radio group with no default selected when the form expects one answer.","Do not describe the control mechanics in the label; describe what the person gets."],t.s)
B.a1T=s(["Don't force a linear wizard on tasks the user could complete in any order; a single form or settings view may fit better.","Don't reorder or renumber steps mid-flow; the progress header should stay stable as the user moves through it.","Don't advance past an invalid step; keep Next disabled rather than letting the user continue and fail later.","Don't place the wizard in an unbounded-height context, where its Expanded body cannot lay out."],t.s)
