B.a2x=s(["Don't make active or upcoming sections tappable; skipping ahead bypasses the flow's gating.","Don't show sub-steps on every section at once; only the active section expands, keeping the rail scannable.","Don't use the rail for a short linear wizard; the progress stepper already covers that."],t.s)
