B.a3_=s(["Use the settings surface itself as the entry point, so users connect exactly where the controls live.","Keep the signed-out view minimal: a clear title, one line of context and a single primary action.","Move any extra explanation into a focused reveal or panel instead of the sign-in card.","Confirm the connected state plainly (a status badge and a way to disconnect) before showing detailed controls."],t.s)
