B.adl=new A.a8("Give `DsListItem` an `onTap` to make the whole row a target. When no trailing widget is supplied, a chevron appears automatically to signal that the row navigates. Set `bordered: true` on `DsList` to group the rows into a rounded card, and keep `showDividers` on so adjacent rows stay visually separate.")
B.a42=s([B.adl],t.E)
B.aeS=new A.a8("Keep the control consistently located across the product so people build muscle memory for it, and always show the account it belongs to so there is no doubt about who is signed in. Signing out should be immediate; only interrupt with a confirmation when there is unsaved work that leaving would discard.")
B.a43=s([B.aeS],t.E)
