B.a49=s(['Don\'t restate the label as its own description ("Ready \u2014 the driver is ready"); say what the status implies and what to do about it.',"Don't use the legend as a filter; it is explanatory, and segments or filter controls do the narrowing.","Don't document statuses the surface never shows; a legend mirrors the live vocabulary, not the full state machine."],t.s)
