B.a6c=s(["Give people the two obvious paths: signing in (the primary action) and creating an account (the `footerBand`).","Compose the password label row from a `DsFieldLabel` and a right-aligned `DsLink`, then a `DsPasswordField` beneath, so recovery sits where people reach for it.","Put alternative providers behind a `DsLabeledDivider` and render each as a `DsButton.social`, so every provider row reads identically.","Offer a remember-me `DsCheckbox` when sessions expire, and default it to checked on consumer products.","Surface a failed sign-in clearly (a banner above the form) and keep the fields filled so they can correct one thing."],t.s)
B.a6d=s(["Organise content into a small set of clearly labelled tabs.","Lead with an overview, then progressively disclose detail.","Keep the page header and its primary actions visible.","Use a consistent header and layout across every page.","Give each section its own deep-linkable route."],t.s)
