B.a6g=s(["Don't stack several blooms to build a scene; one pool is an accent, more is wallpaper.","Don't put small text directly over the densest part of the glow.","Don't use it to signal state; it is decoration, not feedback."],t.s)
B.a6i=s(["Use an accordion to break long content into short, self-contained sections.","Write header titles that summarise the section in one line.","Keep the default single-open mode when only one answer is relevant at a time.","Set allowMultiple: true when sections are independent and often read together.","Open the most important section with initiallyExpanded so the page is useful straight away.","Add a leading icon when it helps people recognise a section faster."],t.s)
