B.a6l=s(["Drive `floating` from the scroll view the bar actually covers.","Keep the link set short; a site bar is not a sitemap.","Mark a link that opens a menu as a dropdown so it announces as a button."],t.s)
B.a6m=s(["Always pass a fixed `now` in tests, demos and screenshots so the relative hint renders deterministically instead of drifting with the wall clock.","Set `dense: true` inside table cells so the compact type sits within a standard row height.","Tune `urgentWithin` to the window in which your process can still act on the expiry; the default is 90 days.","Let the hint text carry the urgency \u2014 it does so in words as well as colour, which is what keeps the state accessible."],t.s)
B.a6n=s(['Don\'t show a "create your first\u2026" action when a filter just returned no matches.',"Don't use promotional or salesy language; stay calm and factual.","Don't confuse an empty state with a loading spinner or an error banner.","Don't stack multiple competing actions; keep to a single primary path."],t.s)
