B.a6V=s(["Keep the template one tap from the instructions: pass `onDownloadTemplate` so the button renders right under the steps that describe the file.",'Write steps as short imperatives in the order people perform them ("Download the CSV template", "Complete all required fields").',"Point `guideLabel` / `onOpenGuide` at the longer-form docs instead of growing the step list.","Perform the real download or navigation in the callbacks; the guide itself never touches IO."],t.s)
B.acI=new A.a8("The same decision reads as a centred dialog on a desktop and a sheet in the thumb zone on a phone. `showDsDialogOrSheet` makes that switch for you at the medium breakpoint, so a screen does not re-write the rule each time. Both surfaces close before running a chosen action, so a navigation that rebuilds the tree never races the closing barrier, and both dismiss on the barrier or Escape.")
B.adO=new A.a8("For a flat list of choices reach for `DsMenu` or `DsMenuSheet` instead: those present options, while these carry arbitrary content.")
B.a6W=s([B.acI,B.adO],t.E)
